t`) directive is\n   181\t  rejected.\n   182\t- **Hardened build flags.** The b
uilder stage MUST invoke\n   183\t  `go build` with `CGO_ENABLED=0` (static bina
ry compatible with\n   184\t  the distroless static image), `-trimpath` (strip l
ocal filesystem\n   185\t  paths from the binary), and `-ldflags="-s -w"` (drop 
the symbol\n   186\t  and DWARF tables). Each missing flag is a separate regress
ion.\n   187\t- **No `ADD <url>`.** Fetching arbitrary content at build time\n  
188\t  without checksum verification is forbidden. Use `COPY` or a\n   189\t  `R
UN curl ... | sha256sum -c` pattern.\n   190\t- **No baked secrets.** The Docker
file MUST NOT declare ENV values\n   191\t  whose key names contain `TOKEN`, `PA
SSWORD`, `SECRET`, `API_KEY`,\n   192\t  `PRIVATE_KEY`, `SIGNING_KEY`, or `DSN`.
