ariables, never\n   194\t  baked into the image.\n   195\t- **No package install
in the runtime stage.** `apt-get`,\n   196\t  `apt install`, `yum install`, `dnf
install`, `microdnf install`,\n   197\t  and `apk add` are rejected in the final
layer. The builder stage\n   198\t  is free to install build dependencies; the r
untime stage is not.\n   199\t- **`COPY --from=builder --chown=nonroot:nonroot`.
** Every\n   200\t  cross-stage COPY into the runtime layer MUST chown to the\n 
 201\t  non-root user so the copied artefact is not owned by root.\n   202\t- **
