T` (not just `CMD`) so `docker run -- <args>` cannot\n   204\t  replace the bina
ry at launch.\n   205\t- **Worker image contract.** `Dockerfile.worker` MUST bui
ld\n   206\t  `./cmd/yalla-worker`, copy `/out/yalla-worker` to\n   207\t  `/usr
